1
00:00:00,384 --> 00:00:02,620
Type: "a tiger in Mumbai rain".

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,424
Seconds later, a picture!

3
00:00:04,424 --> 00:00:06,372
But AI never held a pencil.

4
00:00:06,372 --> 00:00:07,772
So how?

5
00:00:08,975 --> 00:00:09,491
Step 1.

6
00:00:09,491 --> 00:00:11,482
It starts with pure static.

7
00:00:11,482 --> 00:00:13,921
Random noise, like an old TV.

8
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:17,900
Step 2. It learned from millions of

9
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,396
pictures with captions

10
00:00:19,396 --> 00:00:21,028
how to clean noise away,

11
00:00:21,028 --> 00:00:22,756
a tiny bit at a time.

12
00:00:24,248 --> 00:00:26,905
Step 3. Your words steer every clean-up.

13
00:00:26,905 --> 00:00:27,902
Tiger? Stripes.

14
00:00:27,902 --> 00:00:29,302
Rain? Drops.

15
00:00:30,657 --> 00:00:33,343
20, 30, 50 small steps later…

16
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,272
A brand-new picture!

17
00:00:36,272 --> 00:00:38,513
Every pixel, made just for you.

18
00:00:40,066 --> 00:00:42,468
It didn't paint. It un-noised.

19
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:45,616
It's called diffusion.

20
00:00:45,616 --> 00:00:47,142
From static to a story,

21
00:00:47,142 --> 00:00:48,702
one step at a time.

22
00:00:52,611 --> 00:00:55,357
Follow for more AI in 60 seconds!
